Chess-GPT model weights
=======================

The file published in this repository as `chessgpt-lichess-8layers-int8.onnx`
is a DERIVATIVE of Adam Karvonen's Chess-GPT checkpoint
`lichess_8layers_ckpt_no_optimizer.pt`:

  weights: https://huggingface.co/adamkarvonen/chess_llms
  code:    https://github.com/adamkarvonen/chess_llm_interpretability
  paper:   Karvonen, "Emergent World Models and Latent Variable Estimation
           in Chess-Playing Language Models", arXiv:2403.15498

Both upstream repositories declare the MIT licence. The derivation is an ONNX
export followed by int8 dynamic quantisation — no retraining, no fine-tuning,
and no change to what the model has learned.

